<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's January current account deficit falls.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's January current account deficit falls.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's current account deficit in January 1997 fell to 3.8 million dinars from 79.8 million dinars in January 1996, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>It was 530 million dinars for the whole year 1996 compared to 784.8 million dinars in 1995. ($= 1.1025 dinar)</p>
